loss":"like the stripes"},{"surface":"தெறுழ்","parts":[{"text":"தெறுழ்","lemma":"teṟuḻ","gloss":"teṟuḻ shrub"}],"gloss":"teṟuḻ shrub"},{"surface":"வீ","parts":[{"text":"வீ","lemma":"vī","gloss":"flower"}],"gloss":"flowers"},{"surface":"பூப்ப","parts":[{"text":"பூ","lemma":"pū","gloss":"to bloom"},{"text":"ப்ப","lemma":"ppa","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to bloom"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"செம்","parts":[{"text":"செம்","lemma":"செம்","gloss":"red"}],"gloss":"red","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"புற்று","parts":[{"text":"புற்று","lemma":"puṟṟu","gloss":"anthill"}],"gloss":"anthill"},{"surface":"ஈயலின்","parts":[{"text":"ஈயல்","lemma":"īyal","gloss":"winged termite"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with winged termites"},{"surface":"இன்","parts":[{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"sweet"}],"gloss":"sweet","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அளை","parts":[{"text":"அளை","lemma":"aḷai","gloss":"buttermilk"}],"gloss":"buttermilk"},{"surface":"புளித்து","parts":[{"text":"புளி","lemma":"puḷi","gloss":"to ferment"},{"text":"த்து","lemma":"ttu","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having fermented"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மெந்தினை","parts":[{"text":"மெந்தினை","lemma":"மெந்தினை","gloss":"soft millet"}],"gloss":"soft millet","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யாணர்த்து","parts":[{"text":"யாணர்","lemma":"yāṇar","gloss":"fresh prosperity"},{"text":"து","lemma":"tu","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having fresh prosperity"},{"surface":"நந்தும்","parts":[{"text":"நந்து","lemma":"nantu","gloss":"to flourish"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"will"}],"gloss":"will it flourish"},{"surface":"கொல்லோ","parts":[{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"kol","gloss":"particle of doubt"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ō","gloss":"exclamatory particle"}],"gloss":"indeed?"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நிழல்","parts":[{"text":"நிழல்","lemma":"niḻal","gloss":"shade"}],"gloss":"shade"},{"surface":"இல்","parts":[{"text":"இல்","lemma":"il","gloss":"without"}],"gloss":"without"},{"surface":"நீள்","parts":[{"text":"நீள்","lemma":"nīḷ","gloss":"long"}],"gloss":"long"},{"surface":"இடை","parts":[{"text":"இடை","lemma":"iṭai","gloss":"path"}],"gloss":"path"},{"surface":"தனி","parts":[{"text":"தனி","lemma":"taṉi","gloss":"solitary"}],"gloss":"solitary"},{"surface":"மரம்","parts":[{"text":"மரம்","lemma":"maram","gloss":"tree"}],"gloss":"tree"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"pōla","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பணை","parts":[{"text":"பணை","lemma":"paṇai","gloss":"war drum"}],"gloss":"war drum"},{"surface":"கெழு","parts":[{"text":"கெழு","lemma":"keḻu","gloss":"possessing"}],"gloss":"possessing"},{"surface":"வேந்தரை","parts":[{"text":"வேந்தர்","lemma":"vēntar","gloss":"kings"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ai","gloss":"accusative case marker"}],"gloss":"kings"},{"surface":"இறந்தும்","parts":[{"text":"இறந்து","lemma":"iṟantu","gloss":"having passed by"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even passing by"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இரவலர்க்கு","parts":[{"text":"இரவலர்","lemma":"iravalar","gloss":"supplicants"},{"text":"க்கு","lemma":"kku","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to the supplicants"},{"surface":"ஈயும்","parts":[{"text":"ஈ","lemma":"ī","gloss":"to give"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"who gives"}],"gloss":"who gives"},{"surface":"வள்ளியோன்","parts":[{"text":"வள்ளி","lemma":"vaḷḷi","gloss":"generosity"},{"text":"ஓன்","lemma":"ōṉ","gloss":"he who has"}],"gloss":"the generous man"},{"surface":"நாடே","parts":[{"text":"நாடு","lemma":"nāṭu","gloss":"land"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"the land indeed"}]}],"literal":"Rainy season raining having set in beautiful pleasant morning / of male elephant face like stripes teṟuḻ flowers to bloom / red anthill with winged termites sweet buttermilk having fermented / soft millet having fresh prosperity will it flourish indeed? / shade without long path solitary tree like / war drum possessing kings even passing by / to supplicants who gives generous man's land indeed","translation":"In the beautiful, pleasant morning when the rainy season has set in, when the teṟuḻ flowers bloom like the stripes on an elephant's face, and the sweet buttermilk, fermented with winged termites from the red anthill, is prepared, will the land of the generous one still flourish with soft millet and fresh prosperity? He who was like a solitary tree on a long, shadeless path, giving to supplicants, passing by the great kings with their war drums—will his land indeed prosper now?","modern":"மழைக்காலம் தொடங்கிய அழகிய இனிய காலைப் பொழுதில், ஆண் யானையின் முகத்தில் உள்ள வரிகளைப் போலத் தெறுழ் மலர்கள் மலர, செம்மண் புற்றிலிருந்து வெளிப்படும் ஈசல்களுடன் சேர்த்துச் சமைத்த இனிய மோர் புளித்து இருக்கும்படியாக, மென்மையான தினையின் புதிய விளைச்சலோடு அந்த நாடு இனிமேலும் செழிப்படையுமோ? நிழல் இல்லாத நீண்ட வழியில் நிற்கும் ஒற்றை மரத்தைப் போல, முரசு ஏந்திய மூவேந்தர்களைக் கடந்து வந்து இரப்பவர்க்கு வாரி வழங்கும் வள்ளலாகிய பாரியின் நாடு அதுவே.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Potuviyal tiṇai and Kaiyaṟunilai tuṟai, which is a lament on the death of a patron. The poet Kapilar, a close friend of the generous chieftain Pāri, laments Pāri's death after his kingdom of Parampu was destroyed. Kapilar looks at the land of Pāri during the onset of the rainy season, when the teṟuḻ flowers bloom and the people prepare a traditional dish of winged termites and sour buttermilk. He compares Pāri to a solitary, shade-giving tree on a long, hot, shadeless path, who welcomed and gave generously to all supplicants, bypassing the powerful kings. Kapilar wonders with deep grief whether this land, now deprived of its generous lord, will ever flourish again with its soft millet and fresh prosperity.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.8],[0.8,1.1],[1.1,1.4],[1.4,1.6],[1.6,2.36],[2.36,3.3],[3.3,3.5],[3.5,3.6],[3.6,4.29],[4.42,4.7],[4.7,4.92],[4.92,5.78],[6.11,6.44],[6.44,7.0],[7.0,7.4],[7.4,8.56],[8.56,8.56],[8.56,8.7],[8.7,9.3],[9.9,10.7],[10.7,11.27],[11.27,11.7],[11.7,12.1],[12.1,13.0],[13.0,13.5],[13.5,13.6],[13.6,15.0],[15.0,15.2],[15.2,15.84],[15.84,15.92]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,1.2],[1.2,1.5],[1.5,1.7],[1.7,3.23],[3.41,3.6],[3.6,3.8],[3.8,4.0],[4.0,4.5],[4.5,4.5],[4.5,4.5],[4.5,4.5],[4.5,6.5],[7.3,7.4],[7.45,7.6],[7.6,7.6],[7.6,7.8],[7.8,10.1],[10.1,10.1],[10.1,11.2],[11.2,11.6],[11.6,12.2],[12.2,12.6],[12.6,13.2],[13.5,14.0],[14.0,14.1],[14.1,15.5],[15.5,15.8],[15.8,16.1],[16.1,16.62]]},"sync":[[["கார்","rainy season"]],[["பெயல்","raining"]],[["தலைஇய","having set in"]],[["காண்பு","beautiful"]],[["இன்","pleasant"]],[["காலை","morning"]],[["களிற்று","of the male elephant"]],[["முக","face"]],[["வரியின்","like the stripes"]],[["தெறுழ்","teṟuḻ shrub"],["வீ","flowers"]],[["பூப்ப","to bloom"]],[["செம்","red"]],[["புற்று","anthill"]],[["ஈயலின்","with winged termites"]],[["இன்","sweet"],["அளை","buttermilk"],["புளித்து","having fermented"]],[["புளித்து","having fermented"]],[["மெந்தினை","soft millet"]],[["யாணர்த்து","having fresh prosperity"]],[["நந்தும்","will it flourish"]],[["கொல்லோ","indeed?"]],[["நிழல்","shade"],["இல்","without"]],[["நீள்","long"],["இடை","path"]],[["தனி","solitary"],["மரம்","tree"]],[["போல","like"]],[["பணை","war drum"],["கெழு","possessing"]],[["வேந்தரை","kings"]],[["இறந்தும்","even passing by"]],[["இரவலர்க்கு","to the supplicants"]],[["ஈயும்","who gives"]],[["வள்ளியோன்","the generous man"]],[["நாடே","the land indeed"]]]}